    level: optional
        The level(s) to group by if the index is a MultiIndex.
    sort: bool, default True
        Whether to sort the resulting groups.
    observed: bool, default False
        If grouping by a categorical variable, only show observed values.
    mutated: bool, default False
        Whether the object has been mutated.
    validate: bool, default True
        If True, validate the grouper.
    dropna: bool, default True
        If True, drop NA values during grouping.

